## Out of scope

- OIDC / OAuth / passkeys (T0111)
- MFA, forgot password
- Rate limiting (T0085)
- CSRF / cookie hardening beyond T0096 (T0087)
- Role-based admin 403 (T0108)
- Per-user data scoping (T0110)
- API key validation (T0063 — hook only)
- Adding `updatedById` to routes that never had it

## Implementation order

1. Session expiry in `getSessionById` / loader  
2. `requireAuth` middleware + public allowlist + mount on v1 router  
3. `getAuthenticatedUser` / remove U0001 fallback  
4. `/users/me` 401 alignment  
5. Auth failure logging polish  
6. API-key middleware stub / types  
7. SECURITY.md + docs  
8. Tests  
9. QA checklist

## Done when

- `curl` without cookie to e.g. `GET /api/v1/projects` → 401  
- Login → cookie → same route → 200  
- SPA login → browse → mutate → logout → API 401  
- Expired session row → treated as logged out  
- SECURITY.md reflects authenticated API  
- QA checklist delivered; finish-up only on request
